{"id":"1038150eeb41d5b7","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-time-change.md","title":"Time Change","display":"df-time-change — Time Change","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-time-change","aliases":["58-df-time-change"],"display":"df-time-change — Time Change","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-prob2-stopping-time.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-time-change"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-time-change</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-time-change — Time Change"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b5f77bed7dfe3f07\" href=\"?note=b5f77bed7dfe3f07\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md\">../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cef612157cb4ba5d\" href=\"?note=cef612157cb4ba5d\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-prob2-stopping-time.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-prob2-stopping-time.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\">\\((\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\)</span> (probability space), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(E,\\mathcal E)\">\\((E,\\mathcal E)\\)</span> (measurable state space), and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(J\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=(X_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\(X=(X_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y=(Y_s)_{s\\in J}\">\\(Y=(Y_s)_{s\\in J}\\)</span> (stochastic processes)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb F=(\\mathcal F_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\mathbb F=(\\mathcal F_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (filtration) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=(\\tau_s)_{s\\in J}\">\\(\\tau=(\\tau_s)_{s\\in J}\\)</span> (finite stopping-time clock)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathbb N}=\\{\\langle m,n\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^2:m\\leq n\\}\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathbb N}=\\{\\langle m,n\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^2:m\\leq n\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2StoppingTime}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb2StoppingTime}_S\\)</span> (explicit stopping-time contract)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StochProc}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{StochProc}_S\\)</span> (upstream process predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TimeChange}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TimeChange}_S\\)</span> (time-change predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}time\\text{-}change} \\vdash \\mathrm{TimeChange}_S(Y,X,\\tau,J,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,\\mathbb F)\\leftrightarrow J\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{StochProc}_S(X,\\mathbb N,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{StochProc}_S(Y,J,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E)\\land\\tau\\in(\\mathbb N^\\Omega)^J\\land\\bigl(\\forall s\\in J\\;\\mathrm{ZfcProb2StoppingTime}_S(\\tau_s,\\Omega,\\mathbb F,\\mathbb N,\\leq_{\\mathbb N})\\bigr)\\land\\forall s,t\\in J\\;\\Bigl(s\\leq t\\to\\bigl(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:\\tau_s(\\omega)\\leq\\tau_t(\\omega)\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mathbb P\\bigl(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:\\tau_s(\\omega)\\leq\\tau_t(\\omega)\\}\\bigr)=1\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\land\\forall s\\in J\\;\\bigl(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:Y_s(\\omega)=X_{\\tau_s(\\omega)}(\\omega)\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mathbb P\\bigl(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:Y_s(\\omega)=X_{\\tau_s(\\omega)}(\\omega)\\}\\bigr)=1\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}time\\text{-}change} \\vdash \\mathrm{TimeChange}_S(Y,X,\\tau,J,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,\\mathbb F)\\leftrightarrow J\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{StochProc}_S(X,\\mathbb N,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{StochProc}_S(Y,J,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E)\\land\\tau\\in(\\mathbb N^\\Omega)^J\\land\\bigl(\\forall s\\in J\\;\\mathrm{ZfcProb2StoppingTime}_S(\\tau_s,\\Omega,\\mathbb F,\\mathbb N,\\leq_{\\mathbb N})\\bigr)\\land\\forall s,t\\in J\\;\\Bigl(s\\leq t\\to\\bigl(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:\\tau_s(\\omega)\\leq\\tau_t(\\omega)\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mathbb P\\bigl(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:\\tau_s(\\omega)\\leq\\tau_t(\\omega)\\}\\bigr)=1\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\land\\forall s\\in J\\;\\bigl(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:Y_s(\\omega)=X_{\\tau_s(\\omega)}(\\omega)\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mathbb P\\bigl(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:Y_s(\\omega)=X_{\\tau_s(\\omega)}(\\omega)\\}\\bigr)=1\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This atom uses the random discrete-time convention. A deterministic increasing map is the special case in which every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_s\">\\(\\tau_s\\)</span> is constant.</li>\n<li>The clock is explicitly a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span>-indexed family of finite <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span>-valued stopping times, and almost-sure assertions are probabilities of displayed events rather than formulas with a free sample point.</li>\n<li>Each clock now uses the five-place stopping-time predicate with the same sample space, filtration, time set, and order; the two almost-sure events are explicitly required to lie in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md","status":"resolved","id":"b5f77bed7dfe3f07","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-prob2-stopping-time.md","status":"resolved","id":"cef612157cb4ba5d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-prob2-stopping-time.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)","display":false},{"tex":"(E,\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"J\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"X=(X_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"Y=(Y_s)_{s\\in J}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb F=(\\mathcal F_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau=(\\tau_s)_{s\\in J}","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_{\\mathbb N}=\\{\\langle m,n\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^2:m\\leq n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2StoppingTime}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StochProc}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TimeChange}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}time\\text{-}change} \\vdash \\mathrm{TimeChange}_S(Y,X,\\tau,J,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,\\mathbb F)\\leftrightarrow J\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{StochProc}_S(X,\\mathbb N,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{StochProc}_S(Y,J,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E)\\land\\tau\\in(\\mathbb N^\\Omega)^J\\land\\bigl(\\forall s\\in J\\;\\mathrm{ZfcProb2StoppingTime}_S(\\tau_s,\\Omega,\\mathbb F,\\mathbb N,\\leq_{\\mathbb N})\\bigr)\\land\\forall s,t\\in J\\;\\Bigl(s\\leq t\\to\\bigl(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:\\tau_s(\\omega)\\leq\\tau_t(\\omega)\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mathbb P\\bigl(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:\\tau_s(\\omega)\\leq\\tau_t(\\omega)\\}\\bigr)=1\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\land\\forall s\\in J\\;\\bigl(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:Y_s(\\omega)=X_{\\tau_s(\\omega)}(\\omega)\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mathbb P\\bigl(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:Y_s(\\omega)=X_{\\tau_s(\\omega)}(\\omega)\\}\\bigr)=1\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau_s","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F","display":false}],"bytes":2375,"backlinks":[{"id":"5ad1ed6e19770020","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1296","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-time-change.md|58-df-time-change]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["b5f77bed7dfe3f07","cef612157cb4ba5d","0578a357a86e9d8f"]}